  "aiGenJobGuide": {
    "title": "Effective AI Gen Job Guide",
    "subtitle": "AI will automatically generate the job title, category, skills, and detailed description based on your prompt. Follow these 4 steps for the best professional results.",
    "step1Title": "Define Role & Level Clearly",
    "step1Body": "Provide the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">full job title and experience level</strong>. Avoid vague names like <em>\"developer\"</em> — be specific: <em>\"Senior React Developer\"</em>, <em>\"Junior Data Analyst\"</em>, <em>\"Mid-level UI/UX Designer\"</em>.",
    "step2Title": "List Skills & Tech Stack",
    "step2Body": "Clearly specify the required <strong class=\"text-foreground\">languages, frameworks, tools</strong>, and years of experience. For example: <em>\"requires TypeScript, REST API, PostgreSQL — min 2 years experience\"</em>. AI will automatically map these to the matching skills catalog.",
    "step3Title": "State Scope, Budget & Deadline",
    "step3Body": "Mention the <strong class=\"text-foreground\">project scope, expected budget range, and timeline</strong>. For example: <em>\"3-month project, budget 5-10 million VND, to be completed before September 2026\"</em>. This helps AI tailor the description accurately.",
    "step4Title": "Generate, then Review & Edit",
